# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# js
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# debug
npm-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# nix
.direnv/
result
result-*
.devshell

# agents
## `.claude/` doubles as CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR (see AGENTS.md "Agent configuration"), so it mixes
## tracked project config with runtime state and credentials. Ignore everything, then
## re-include only the config a clone needs -- deny-by-default, so a future Claude Code
## release that adds a new state directory stays ignored without a change here.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/output-styles
.agents/skills/*-workspace/
